        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Find the Edges\n\nTraces the outlines in an image with Canny edge detection. Use it for line art, masks, or as a control image for generation.\n\n**How it works:** \"Image\" passes the picture to \"Canny\". The low threshold (80) decides what counts as a weak edge and the high threshold (180) what counts as a certain one. Weak edges survive only when they connect to certain ones. \"Result\" shows the edge map. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Lower the high threshold on \"Canny\" to 100 to keep fainter outlines, or raise the low threshold to drop texture noise."
        },
